# Build output — see /Makefile. Nothing under here is a source file: release/ is
# Arch OS as a machine runs it, dist/ is what a person downloads, and .dev/ is
# the same shape as release/ made of symlinks, for running against the sources.
/release/
/dist/
/.dev/

# What a local run leaves beside itself, wherever it runs from. Each module
# names its answers and its log after itself, and the runtime keeps what belongs
# to every module in one of its own — see runtime/main.go.
runtime.conf
installer.conf
installer.conf.old
installer.log
installer.log.old
recovery.conf
recovery.conf.old
recovery.log
recovery.log.old

# Editors / OS noise
*.swp
.DS_Store
